#==============================================================================================
#
#   block_formatting_context_5 - Layout::BlockFormattingContext: floats, list item markers,
#                                float intrusions and multi-column widths
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/Layout/BlockFormattingContext.cpp (lines 1230-1735): layout_floating_box
#       (floating to the left or right edge, stacking beside preceding floats or below them,
#       moving below opposite-side floats that leave no room), the size and position of list
#       item markers, the space floats use at a given y, their intrusion into a box,
#       greatest_child_width with floats, and the used column count, width and gap of a
#       multi-column container. The C++ `float_box` lambda and the lambdas nested in it share
#       their state through LayoutFloatPlacement.
#
#       Copyright (c) 2020-2022, Andreas Kling <andreas@ladybird.org>
